Over-Broad Wildcard IAM Policy

Review an IAM policy attached to a deployment role. It uses wildcards that grant far more than the role needs. Identify the risk and the least-privilege fix.

iam://policy:
{
  'Version': '2012-10-17',
  'Statement': [
    {
      'Effect': 'Allow',
      'Action': '*',
      'Resource': '*'
    }
  ]
}
role needs only: put objects to bucket 'artifacts'

