MFA and Conditional Access

A privileged policy should only take effect when the caller has authenticated with MFA. Complete the condition and pick the right access concepts.

iam://policy/condition:
{
  'Effect': 'Allow',
  'Action': ['ec2:TerminateInstances'],
  'Resource': '*',
  'Condition': {
    'Bool': { '____': 'true' }
  }
}
goal: require MFA for destructive actions

