RBAC vs ABAC Authorization

A team wants access decided by resource tags (department, environment) rather than static roles. Map the requirement to the right authorization model and complete the tag condition.

iam://abac-policy:
{
  'Effect': 'Allow',
  'Action': 's3:*',
  'Resource': '*',
  'Condition': {
    'StringEquals': {
      '____': '${aws:PrincipalTag/dept}'
    }
  }
}
match resource tag 'dept' to the principal's dept

